Cairn v0.0.15 — private, end-to-end encrypted location sharing.

New since v0.0.6:
• History: a timeline of where you stopped and travelled; save a stop as a place.
• Places & arrival/leave alerts.
• Shared pins and a "where I am" label for your contacts.
• Interactive map: tap people, long-press to add a place or pin, follow mode.
• Nicknames, last-seen and per-contact controls.
